			"notes": "I'm releasing this alpha for the purpose of testing the redesigned version of the alchemy system I've implemented, it's based on the game mastermind. The Ancient Codex has entries explaining how the new system works so I won't be getting into detail here. I've also added an item called the Codebreaking Slate that will help you with figuring out alchemy recipes, its recipe is intended to introduce players to alchemy while teaching them that codes can have duplicate colors.\n\nCurrently there are 11 alchemy recipes to try out, 3 of which are examples that will be removed in the next version.\n\nWhat has been added since the last alpha:\n- Item Transfer\n- Fluid Transfer\n- Required blocks for ember bore recipes\n- Beam Cannon\n- Alchemy Pedestal\n- Exchange Tablet\n- Acient golems spawning in the world\n- Lead, Silver and Dawnstone tools\n- Caminite Gauge\n- Codebreaking Slate"
		},
