			"notes": "This is the third alpha I'm releasing for my port of Embers Rekindled, please try it out and give me your feedback and bug reports if you have any.\nJust like with the previous alphas, this alpha is not ready for survival play or modpacks and existing worlds might break.\n\nWhat has been added since the last alpha:\n* Silver ore, ingot, nugget, block and raw item\n* Clockwork Attenuator\n* Geologic Separator\n* Ingot/Nugget tooltips for fluid dials\n* Mirror Relay\n* Copper Charger\n* Ember Siphon\n* Ember Jar\n* Ember Cartridge\n* Clockwork Axe\n* Clockwork Pickaxe\n* Grandhammer\n* Blazing Ray\n* Cinder Staff\n\nI also added a highlight for connecting emitters and receptors, please tell me what you think of them.\n\n![2023-06-10_22 44 51](https://github.com/RCXcrafter/EmbersRekindled/assets/10962454/afcc1a6c-c31d-4847-991e-1b4bd9ac829d)"
