			"notes": "This is the second alpha I'm releasing for my port of Embers Rekindled, please try it out and give me your feedback and bug reports if you have any.\n\nJust like with the previous alpha, this alpha is not ready for survival play or modpacks and existing worlds might break.\n\nWhat has been added since the last alpha:\n- Ancient Codex\n- Ancient Golem\n- Archaic decoration blocks\n- Mixer Centrifuge\n- Atmospheric Gauge\n- Item Dropper\n- Pressure Refinery\n- Ember Ejector\n- Ember Funnel\n- Ember Relay\n- Beam Splitter\n- Item Vacuum\n- Hearth Coil\n- Reservoir\n- Caminite Ring\n- Caminite Valve\n- Stairs Slabs and Walls for the decoration blocks\n- Ember Lantern\n- Crystal Cell"
		},
