			"notes": "This is the first alpha I'm releasing for my port of Embers Rekindled, it contains all of the basic content that is required for the mod to be usable in survival as well as a few things that aren't strictly required but very useful.\n\nKeep in mind that even though the mod is playable in survival that doesn't mean it's ready for actual survival play or modpacks, I'm releasing this alpha for testing purposes and to get feedback on what I have so far. I wil take no responsibility if your world breaks.\n\nHere is a list of what I have ported so far (not including crafting ingredients):\n- Copper Cell\n- Creative Ember Source\n- Ember Dial\n- Item Dial\n- Fluid Dial\n- Ember Emitter\n- Ember Receiver\n- Caminite Lever\n- Item Pipe and Extractor\n- Ember Bore\n- Mechanical Core\n- Ember Activator\n- Melter\n- Fluid Pipe and Extractor\n- Fluid Vessel\n- Stamper and Stamp Base\n- Bin\n- Tinker's Hammer\n- Tinker's lens\n- JEI support for Bore, Activator, Melter and Stamper"
